<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on March 14.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on March 14.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				March 14	     March 13</p>
<p>Fed acct			 5.050		  4.894</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	   7.737		  8.323</p>
<p>Cash balance		  12.787		 13.217</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,275.342	     5,274.513</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $6.746 billion were issued and $284 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
